          "title": "You'll want to know: بوند",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بوند — būṅd — \"a drop\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بارش کی پہلی بوند میرے ہاتھ پر گری۔ bārish kī pehlī būṅd mere hāth par girī. The first drop of rain fell on my hand."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بوند (būṅd) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin bū̃d, \"a drop\", under Sanskrit bindú, \"a drop, a spot\" (CDIAL 9240)."
            }
          ]
        },
